#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use cases {#use-cases}"
msgstr "Casi d'uso {#use-cases}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Typical use cases for the Optimization solver are combinatorial optimization problems. You can solve problems from many industries like finance, pharmaceutics, or logistics. Some examples follow.\n"
"* Portfolio optimization (QUBO): [scientific publication](https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevApplied.22.054037) and [white paper](https://kipu-quantum.com/zope64/kipu_2024/content/e3915/e3916/e4187/White-Paper-2-Financial-modeling-on-quantum-computers-using-digitally-compressed-algorithms-1.pdf)\n"
"* Protein folding (HUBO): [scientific publication](https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevApplied.20.014024)\n"
"* Logistics scheduling (QUBO): [scientific publication](https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevApplied.22.064068)\n"
"* Network optimization: [webinar](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w5SrCIK88No)\n"
"* Market split (QUBO): [tutorial](/tutorials/solve-market-split-problem-with-iskay-quantum-optimizer)\n"
msgstr ""
"I casi d'uso tipici per il solver di ottimizzazione sono i problemi di ottimizzazione combinatoria. Puoi risolvere problemi di molti settori come la finanza, la farmaceutica o la logistica. Seguono alcuni esempi.\n"
"* Ottimizzazione di portafoglio (QUBO): [pubblicazione scientifica](https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevApplied.22.054037) e [white paper](https://kipu-quantum.com/zope64/kipu_2024/content/e3915/e3916/e4187/White-Paper-2-Financial-modeling-on-quantum-computers-using-digitally-compressed-algorithms-1.pdf)\n"
"* Protein folding (HUBO): [pubblicazione scientifica](https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevApplied.20.014024)\n"
"* Pianificazione logistica (QUBO): [pubblicazione scientifica](https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevApplied.22.064068)\n"
"* Ottimizzazione di rete: [webinar](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w5SrCIK88No)\n"
"* Market split (QUBO): [tutorial](/tutorials/solve-market-split-problem-with-iskay-quantum-optimizer)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are interested in tackling a specific use case and develop a dedicated mapping, we can assist you. [Contact us](https://share-eu1.hsforms.com/2Ff8cgWvTR9ukT_fPoaNhDw2dqpz5).\n"
msgstr "Se sei interessato ad affrontare un caso d'uso specifico e sviluppare una mappatura dedicata, possiamo assisterti. [Contattaci](https://share-eu1.hsforms.com/2Ff8cgWvTR9ukT_fPoaNhDw2dqpz5).\n"

